## 3. Secure Product Development Framework (SPDF)

- No SOUP without authorization (CON-SUP-01); single curated dependency repo ({{artifact_repo}})
- CycloneDX SBOM per build
- Secure coding: no PHI in logs, structured logging, secrets via secrets port, no secrets in code
- Code review + automated tests + traceability annotation
- Threat modeling maintained across the lifecycle
- Formal SPDF SOP [QMS — OPEN-04]

